    IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
    PROGRAM-ID. COMP-FARES.

    DATA DIVISION.
    LINKAGE SECTION.
    COPY "RECORD-DEF.cpy".

    PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUT-RECORD OUTPUT-RECORD.
    0000-PROCESS-FARES.
        EVALUATE IN-LOYALTY-TIER
            WHEN "PLATINUM  "
                COMPUTE OUT-FINAL-FARE = IN-BASE-FARE * 0.80
                MOVE 1000 TO OUT-MILES-EARNED
            WHEN "GOLD      "
                COMPUTE OUT-FINAL-FARE = IN-BASE-FARE * 0.90
                MOVE 500  TO OUT-MILES-EARNED
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE IN-BASE-FARE TO OUT-FINAL-FARE
                MOVE 100  TO OUT-MILES-EARNED
        END-EVALUATE

        GOBACK.
